      "statement": "MANAGED_ENV_KEYS is the single source of truth for every env var OpenWiki reads or persists, in file-write order, and both CREDENTIAL_DIAGNOSTIC_ENV_KEYS and DEBUG_ENV_KEYS are derived from it by filtering so they cannot drift out of sync when a new managed key is added.",
