      "statement": "The openai-compatible provider exposes two independent boolean toggles (true only when the value trims to \"true\"): OPENWIKI_OPENAI_COMPATIBLE_USE_RESPONSES_API routes through the Responses API, and OPENWIKI_OPENAI_COMPATIBLE_STREAMING forces the SSE streaming HTTP transport for gateways that only serve streaming.",
